sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Coordinator
    participant G as Gateway
    participant AD as admission-service
    participant ID as identity-service
    participant K as Kafka
    participant FI as finance-service
    participant RP as reporting-service
    participant NO as notification-service
    participant CR as course / batch

    Note over C,AD: A public enquiry becomes a lead
    C->>G: POST /api/leads/enquiry (public) or staff adds a lead
    G->>AD: forward
    AD->>AD: lead NEW, follow-ups, overdue list

    C->>G: POST /api/leads/{id}/convert (course, batch, fee)
    G->>AD: forward (STAFF only)
    AD->>ID: POST /api/users (Feign): create STUDENT login
    ID->>ID: temporary password, must change at first sign-in
    ID->>K: user-created
    ID->>K: notification.requested (login details)
    AD->>AD: save student, lead -> CONVERTED
    AD->>K: student-admitted (after commit)
    AD->>K: profile-linked

    par Identity learns the profile id
        K->>ID: profile-linked
        ID->>ID: store student id for future tokens
    and Finance raises the fee plan
        K->>FI: student-admitted
        FI->>FI: fee plan + instalments (idempotent by event id)
        FI->>K: fee-plan-created
    and Reporting counts it
        K->>RP: student-admitted
    and The student is told
        K->>NO: notification.requested
        NO->>NO: email via outbox with the temporary password (never stored)
    end

    C->>G: place the student in a batch
    G->>CR: batch-service creates the enrolment
    CR->>K: enrollment-created
    K->>CR: course-service unlocks lessons
    K->>NO: notification (batch members)
